 4. ❤️ 1 song thing: Nashville celebrates Dolly Day 
 
 
 &nbsp; 
 
 Dolly Parton performs in Nashville in 2025. Photo: Jason Kempin/Getty Images Music City is going all out to celebrate Dolly Day, Axios Nashville's Adam Tamburin reports. 

 The celebration falls on 9/25, paying homage to Dolly Parton's classic "9 to 5." 🎉 More than 145 events, parties and fundraisers are planned across the city.

 Coffee shops and bars are launching Dolly-themed menu items, many of them featuring her signature shades of pink. 🎸 Local music venues will host performances of "9 to 5" at 5 p.m.

 A downtown fireworks show at 9:25 p.m. will cap the celebration. Go deeper ... Get Axios Local . 

 
 
